    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love fishing and fashion? Then this is the game for you! Fish Flash is a simple arcade game where you maneuver your net to the left, right, and middle positions to gather as many fish as you can while avoiding the nasty snakes. Playing earns you currency that can be spent on cosmetics. Got a competitive streak in you? Try to make it to the top of the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was originally made as a mobile time-killer and is based on a nostalgic mini-game from my childhood. Perhaps you can guess the inspiration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a tiny game, but has quite a few achievements to attain, so if you're into that kinda thing, have at ye.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love fishing and fashion? Then this is the game for you! Fish Flash is a simple arcade game where you maneuver your net to the left, right, and middle positions to gather as many fish as you can while avoiding the nasty snakes. Playing earns you currency that can be spent on cosmetics. Got a competitive streak in you? Try to make it to the top of the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was originally made as a mobile time-killer and is based on a nostalgic mini-game from my childhood. Perhaps you can guess the inspiration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a tiny game, but has quite a few achievements to attain, so if you're into that kinda thing, have at ye.</p>",
